! =====================================================================
! BOLD / SATURATED BACKGROUND THEMES
! These use your original saturated bg/fg picks (Greenie, Ole Yeller,
! Red, Powder). Unlike the muted themes above, a fully saturated
! background shares a hue with some LS_COLORS entries (green bg vs.
! green "sg" text, blue bg vs. blue "di" text, yellow bg vs. yellow
! "pi"/"bd"/"cd" text) -- same-hue text on a same-hue bg goes nearly
! invisible no matter the exact shade. Since ls only cares about ANSI
! slot NUMBERS, not their traditional color name, the colliding slots
! below are deliberately reassigned to a contrasting hue for THIS
! theme only, purely for visibility. This is why, for example, color10 (the
! slot that LS_COLORS sg=1;32 renders through) is not very "green" in
! Greenie -- it cannot be and still show up.
! =====================================================================

! --- Greenie ---
XTermGreenie*background:        #048c14
XTermGreenie*foreground:        #f5f5f5
XTermGreenie*cursorColor:       #ffffff
XTermGreenie*color0:            #023309
XTermGreenie*color1:            #ff5555
XTermGreenie*color2:            #0b5e1a
XTermGreenie*color3:            #ffd447
XTermGreenie*color4:            #4aa3ff
XTermGreenie*color5:            #ff6ec7
XTermGreenie*color6:            #45e0d0
XTermGreenie*color7:            #d0d0d0
XTermGreenie*color8:            #b0bec5
XTermGreenie*color9:            #ff7b7b
XTermGreenie*color10:           #e6ff8f
XTermGreenie*color11:           #ffe97a
XTermGreenie*color12:           #7ec8ff
XTermGreenie*color13:           #ffa3e0
XTermGreenie*color14:           #7bfff0
XTermGreenie*color15:           #ffffff
XTermGreenie*faceName:          DejaVu Sans Mono
XTermGreenie*faceSize:          24

